  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27543001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "主人，你这是在……打游戏？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27543002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯，这个是最近很火的一个双人竞技小游戏。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27543003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "哈欠……主人，真的很有干劲呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27543004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "葵也喜欢玩游戏吗？要不要和我一开黑？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27543005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "唔……我考虑一下……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27543006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "据说进入全球前一百的玩家，可以获得神秘大奖。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "27543008",
              "text": "你看，这是不同排名对应的奖品名单，有感兴趣的吗？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "27543008",
              "text": "嗯……？第98名是稀有品种的向日葵种子？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "27543007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27543008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "唔……决定了，主人，一起开黑吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27543009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "我想和主人一起种向日葵，而且……\n如果可以睡在向日葵上的话，那一整天都晒到太阳吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27543010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那样的话，葵会受伤的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27543011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "你是说长时间暴晒会导致的软化问题吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27543012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "但如果葵真的很想，我会陪着葵的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27543013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "一起晒太阳吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27543014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯，然后，一起回家。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
